                    Secret. Drafted by Robert Burke (PM/ISO) on November 19; cleared by
                    Robert C. Houdek (AF/I), Woolf Gross (NEA/RA), David Gompert (PM), George Churchill (PM/ISO), and Lake. Churchill initialed the letter; Burke
                    initialed on behalf of the other clearing officials. A copy was sent to
                        Brzezinski.</p>
